& [Work]
  + preserved source and completed SJS review and phase lock before implementation
  + implemented four strict immutable phases with envelope response and marker commitments
  + separated iteration admission from terminal-reflection admission
  + reconstructed the complete fixture lifecycle from Slice6D custody
