& [Observation]
  + explicit staging prevents a tool wrapper from treating packet construction response availability and response acceptance as the same event
  + a supplied response may be locally intact yet unauthoritative until it matches the canonical packet-response pair
  + the future effectful adapter now has one narrow insertion seam between Prepared and response recording

& [FacultyAttribution]
  + Honesty prevented fixture evidence from being described as physical provider execution
  + Security guarded preparation with local integrity and admission with canonical reconstruction
  + Planner fixed the only legal phase sequence
  + Weaver connected packet marker response and canonical transport into one lineage
  + Scribe retained exact values digests counters and denials
  + Refiner kept provider process timing streaming and persistence out of the pure core
